      "TEXT": "Orc",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S227SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S227EV000e",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Legion Story",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S227SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S227EV000e",
      "ID_STRING": "POPUP_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Ashkael \n\u0022The small kingdom of Bythazar has a high concentration of gold deposit. The area is well guarded by Orcs and the like, but we must capture Bythazar. We will teach this Daxam what it means to insult the Legions!\u0022",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S227SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S227EV000f",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Mountain Clans Story",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S227SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S227EV000f",
      "ID_STRING": "POPUP_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Advisor \n\u0022By assassinating Daxam,  we risk the chance of his people turning on us. Yes, they are angry with their ruler, but they will not easily accept a new one. Once the Prince is assasinated, we need to capture Bythazar immediatly and restore order.\u0022",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S227SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S227EV0010",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Elite Guard",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S227SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S227EV0010",
      "ID_STRING": "POPUP_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Bragon of the Hills \n\u0022By heavily taxing the people of Bythazar, Prince Daxam is financing his elite guard. The castle\u0027s guards are supplied with the finest armor and weapons that gold can buy.\u0022\n",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S227SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S227UN0033",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Goblin",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S227SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S227EV0011",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Marauder Message",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S227SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S227EV0011",
      "ID_STRING": "POPUP_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Ashkael \n\u0022One of Prince Daxam\u0027s subjects has been seen negotiating with a merchant. The merchant is part of a powerful guild known only as the Marauders. Rumor has it that the Prince has decided to seek protection for his castle.\u0022",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S227SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S227EV0013",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Warning",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S227SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S227EV0013",
      "ID_STRING": "POPUP_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Specter \n\u0022Turn away and leave thisss place. Unlesss of course you want to embraccce death as I have.\u0022",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S227SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S227UN0037",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Goblin Attack",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S227SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S227EV0015",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Zombie Berserk",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S227SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S227EV0016",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Mystash Text",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S227SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S227EV0016",
      "ID_STRING": "POPUP_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Elite Army Soldier \n\u0022The Damned here...in our kingdom? We will surrender to your might, but Prince Daxam will not give in so easily. He has been meeting with merchants who deal in the bizarre, who knows what he may bring back...\u0022",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S227SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S227EV0017",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Thug Attack",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S227SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S227UN003b",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Orc",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S227SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S227EV0018",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Phonycian",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S227SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S227EV0018",
      "ID_STRING": "POPUP_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Phonycian  \n\u0022The Sssspider Scepter...the Sssspider Scepter. It feels good to be dead, sssseek the ssspider or the ssscepter and join us. All the hurt will go away...\u0022",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S227SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S227EV0019",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Phonycian Message For LD",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S227SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S227EV0019",
      "ID_STRING": "POPUP_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Phonycian \n\u0022Prince Daxam is a fool and his father\u0027sss kingdom will fall to ruin. I can sense that the King will die at the hands of the Undead Hordesss. Ohhh...you ssseek the shield? The vampire will love having guesssts.\u0022\u0013",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S227SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S227EV001a",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Legion Message",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S227SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S227EV001a",
      "ID_STRING": "POPUP_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Arch-Devil \n\u0022We have learned that this area contains a statue sacred to the Mountain Clans. Only the Mountain Clans can enter its presence unharmed, anyone else shall be struck down by the power of their pathetic god!\u0022",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S227SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S227EV001b",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Legion Punishment",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S227SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S227EV001c",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Mountain Message",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S227SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S227EV001c",
      "ID_STRING": "POPUP_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Hill Giant \n\u0022This statue only for demons. Only Legions can use powers. We go near and we cursed!\u0022",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S227SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S227EV001d",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Mountain Punishment",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S227SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S227EV001e",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Turn Away Message",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S227SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S227EV001e",
      "ID_STRING": "POPUP_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Thug \n\u0022Seeing as I have blocked your path and saved your lives from the giant spider beyond, I figure you owe me quite a bit of gold. If you aren\u0027t feeling charitable today, I have a pair of sharp little friends who may change your mind.\u0022",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S227SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S227EV001f",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": "City Guard",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S227SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S227EV001f",
      "ID_STRING": "POPUP_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Elite Spearman \n\u0022Halt! No one passes this gate, the Phonycian castle is home to the traitors of Bythazar! Such is the order of Daxam\u0027s father, King Virgil.\u0022",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S227SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S227EV0020",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Giant Spider II",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S227SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S227EV0021",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Giant Spider III",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S227SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S227UN0044",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Orc",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S227SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S227EV0022",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Merchant Warning",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S227SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S227EV0022",
      "ID_STRING": "POPUP_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Peasant \n\u0022There is danger all around! There are beasts and dragons that attack out of the thickness of the night. You should have taken the unearthly creature\u0027s warning!\u0022",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S227SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S227EV0023",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Orc King",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S227SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S227EV0023",
      "ID_STRING": "POPUP_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Orc \n\u0022You bring news about King of Orc? No? You come here for us chop into many parts?\u0022",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S227SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S227EV0024",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Vampire",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S227SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S227EV0024",
      "ID_STRING": "POPUP_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Vampire \n\u0022Come closer...closer...and you will see in my eyes the fate that you desire. Come closer and you will learn where the  unholy artifact lies.\u0022",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S227SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S227UN0047",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Orc",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S227SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S227EV0025",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Vampire Message II",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S227SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S227EV0025",
      "ID_STRING": "POPUP_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Vampire \n\u0022Come closer...closer...and you will learn the secret to defeating Prince Daxam. Come closer and you may learn of great treasure...are you afraid?\u0022",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S227SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S227EV0026",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Leave Our Home",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S227SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S227EV0026",
      "ID_STRING": "POPUP_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Phonycian Zombie \n\u0022Leave thissss place and live. Ssssstay and you will become one of ussss, the outcastsss of Bythazar - a  Phonycian!\u0022 ",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S227SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S227EV0027",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Turn One",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S227SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S227EV0027",
      "ID_STRING": "POPUP_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Advisor \n\u0022Sire, the Orcs and their kin have managed to enter our caverns. They are sealing up our passages. The Orcs do not have the capacity for such a plan, there must someone manipulating them. My instinct tells me it\u0027s the brat Prince Daxam...\u0022\u0013\u0013\u0013",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S227SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S227EV0028",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": "It is me",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S227SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S227EV0028",
      "ID_STRING": "POPUP_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Phonycian Insurrectionist \n\u0022It was I who manipulated the headstrong  against you. Prince Daxam and his father are fools!The Phonycians will soon be the masters of this land and on that day the Undead Hordes will emerge and spread death and decay!\u0022",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S227SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S227UN004c",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Squire",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S227SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S227EV0029",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": "I am no peasant",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S227SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S227EV0029",
      "ID_STRING": "POPUP_TXT",
      "TEXT": "General \n\u0022I am no peasant! Face me and know certain defeat.  I hope you enjoyed my Orcs. They\u0027re not too bright, but easily bought. Daxam\u0027s wealth will bring about many other surprises, but you will never see them.\u0022",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S227SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S227EV002a",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Turn One MC",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S227SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S227EV002a",
      "ID_STRING": "POPUP_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Advisor \n\u0022The Orcs have managed to find their way into our mountain base. The dense creatures have managed to seal off most of the entrances. The Orcs do not have the intelligence to create such a plan, there must be someone controlling them...Daxam?\u0022",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S227SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S227EV002c",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Prince Assassin",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S227SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S227EV002c",
      "ID_STRING": "POPUP_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Elite Army Soldier \n\u0022Prince Daxam has given the order to execute any and all enemies of the state. Guess what...this means you!\u0022",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S227SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S227UN004f",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Squire",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S227SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S227EV002d",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": "New Event",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S227SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S227EV002d",
      "ID_STRING": "POPUP_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Ashkael \n\u0022The Prince is organizing a new force - his elite guard. These castle soldiers are to be supplied with the finest armor and weapons gold can buy, and I fear he may have a few other surprises at his disposal.\u0022",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S227SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S227EV002e",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Marauder Clans",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S227SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S227EV002e",
      "ID_STRING": "POPUP_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Advisor \n\u0022A member of the royal family and a group of merchants were seen together. The consortium is known in some territories as the Marauders. These merchants deal in everything including mercenaries. We can expect the Prince to have reinforcements.\u0022",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S227SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S227UN0052",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Peasant",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S227SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S227EV002f",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Phonycian Message",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S227SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S227EV002f",
      "ID_STRING": "POPUP_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Phonycian  \n\u0022We Phonycians shall have our revenge upon the Daxam and his foreign mercenaries. Anyone who interferes will fall alongside the Prince.\u0022 \n",
